01:04:15,935 --> 01:04:17,936
<i>Will the final five
of the competition</i>

1219
01:04:17,937 --> 01:04:19,606
<i>please report to my office?</i>

1220
01:04:23,401 --> 01:04:24,818
Any idea what this is about?

1221
01:04:24,819 --> 01:04:25,904
No idea.

1222
01:04:31,576 --> 01:04:33,035
Come on in.

1223
01:04:33,036 --> 01:04:34,079
Have a seat.

1224
01:04:38,833 --> 01:04:40,376
I know that one of you has a phone.

1225
01:04:42,170 --> 01:04:43,545
Who is it?

1226
01:04:43,546 --> 01:04:44,671
You knew the rule.

1227
01:04:44,672 --> 01:04:48,259
No phones, no posting, no excuses.

1228
01:04:50,804 --> 01:04:52,763
I could disqualify all of you.

1229
01:04:52,764 --> 01:04:53,765
No!

1230
01:04:57,227 --> 01:04:59,896
Well, I haven't seen my phone
since I turned it in.

1231
01:05:02,732 --> 01:05:04,066
Don't look at me.

1232
01:05:04,067 --> 01:05:05,818
My mom won't even let me have a phone.

1233
01:05:05,819 --> 01:05:08,446
She thinks I have focus issues,
which is ridiculous.

1234
01:05:10,198 --> 01:05:11,573
Sorry.

1235
01:05:11,574 --> 01:05:15,662
I may not take things seriously,
but I wouldn't break this rule.

1236
01:05:18,373 --> 01:05:19,541
That leaves you two.

1237
01:05:20,792 --> 01:05:23,127
Guys, the competition's
on the line.

1238
01:05:23,128 --> 01:05:25,420
Connect 3 still needs an opening act.

1239
01:05:25,421 --> 01:05:28,383
Fletch... just tell them.

1240
01:05:31,094 --> 01:05:32,302
Are you being serious?

1241
01:05:32,303 --> 01:05:34,139
What is she talking about?

1242
01:05:40,186 --> 01:05:41,187
Uh...

1243
01:06:01,708 --> 01:06:03,876
I hope you're happy with yourself, Fletch.

1244
01:06:03,877 --> 01:06:07,672
A video of all of you singing on the bus
has already gone viral.

1245
01:06:08,798 --> 01:06:10,799
Yeah. I've been doing
damage control all day.

1246
01:06:10,800 --> 01:06:13,177
The brothers are not happy about this.

1247
01:06:13,178 --> 01:06:15,262
The competition was supposed
to be a big reveal.

1248
01:06:15,263 --> 01:06:16,513
No, wait! He...

1249
01:06:16,514 --> 01:06:17,724
He would never do that.

1250
01:06:18,474 --> 01:06:20,184
Everyone out!

1251
01:06:20,185 --> 01:06:21,269
Fletch, you stay.

1252
01:06:29,027 --> 01:06:31,153
-Fletch.
-Sage.

1253
01:06:31,154 --> 01:06:33,406
-Go.
-Connie, it wasn't me, I swear.

1254
01:06:34,741 --> 01:06:38,036
Well, if you didn't
post it, Fletch, then who did?

1255
01:06:47,170 --> 01:06:48,713
Be honest. Am I the worst?

1256
01:06:49,589 --> 01:06:50,839
Define worst.

1257
01:06:50,840 --> 01:06:52,217
Desi, be serious.

1258
01:06:52,842 --> 01:06:54,635
I mean, did Fletch have a phone?

1259
01:06:54,636 --> 01:06:55,720
Yeah.

1260
01:06:56,262 --> 01:06:58,306
But did you have to tell Connie about it?

1261
01:07:00,141 --> 01:07:02,393
I mean, we were all
gonna get disqualified.

1262
01:07:03,269 --> 01:07:04,978
I couldn't risk not competing.

1263
01:07:04,979 --> 01:07:07,579
