with what the Final Jam is.

1283
01:08:19,345 --> 01:08:21,264
Well, get ready for my Final Jam.

1284
01:08:21,848 --> 01:08:25,475
Lark, you let your hair down, literally.

1285
01:08:25,476 --> 01:08:27,769
How nice of you to notice, Jason.

1286
01:08:27,770 --> 01:08:32,274
I have bug bites on my bug bites
and a lot to discuss with my therapist.

1287
01:08:32,275 --> 01:08:33,734
You'll be getting the invoice.

1288
01:08:33,735 --> 01:08:36,988
Oh, come on, you're gonna miss this place.
You know you are.

1289
01:08:37,655 --> 01:08:39,114
I guess the songs are kinda catchy.

1290
01:08:39,115 --> 01:08:41,033
You know what? I don't have time for this.

1291
01:08:41,034 --> 01:08:43,285
I'm busy. I'll see you later.
Don't be late.

1292
01:08:43,286 --> 01:08:44,287
I saw that smile.

1293
01:08:45,788 --> 01:08:47,247
You think we pay her enough?

1294
01:08:47,248 --> 01:08:49,167
-Probably not.
-How many bug bites?

1295
01:09:02,847 --> 01:09:04,139
Wow.

1296
01:09:04,140 --> 01:09:05,475
This view never gets old.

1297
01:09:06,225 --> 01:09:08,936
It is so good to be back,
especially with you guys.

1298
01:09:10,021 --> 01:09:11,897
I just can't believe
little Lennon McCartney

1299
01:09:11,898 --> 01:09:13,178
gets to spend every summer here.

